==Strategy==
This level is not as much hard as an annoyance. The spam of constant Yonshakudama Fireworks is not much of a threat if you have an area attacker like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. Just put down a lot of cats and you will slowly progress through the stage. Make sure to beat this level before a minute after you get the base to 99%, as the boss will spawn and cause issues. If you get to the base before the boss spawns, you will have a very easy time beating this level.

