==Strategy==
Stall out the beginning to farm some money, while making sure the Lucky Sloth doesn't get far enough. Spawn [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] as soon as you can, as the first of the difficult enemies approaches. You absolutely want to kill them off before the Gory Groom spawns, due to it having 600k hp, and being a massive rusher. If you can, try to chip off some of the Lucky Sloth's hp once the first group goes down, as Bahamut outranges Lucky Sloth. The Gory Groom is next, and if you have good anti-Dark tankers, Gory Groom is unlikely to do a lot of pushing, but if you don't, you're gonna need at least 3 meat shields for this part. Unless you have highly leveled cats, the final group is likely to come before the Gory Groom can be killed, so deal as much damage as possible, as the duo of Easter enemies, combined with Gory Groom, is a nightmare of a pusher. If Gory Groom is killed beforehand, however, then the easter enemies pose little threat, and you'll be able to finish off the stage.

