==Strategy==
Lure the first Count Owlbrow to your base and use a combination of [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to beat him up. Le'mammoth will hit Bahamut, which will let him rebound and continue to beat up Le'mammoth. Once he's dead, you're free to clean up the rest of the stage. Ms. Madonna can be easily dealt with using backliners like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]].

