==Strategy==
It is heavily reccomended to boost your units here; level 30 units aren't going to cut it here at all.

If you don't have any strong Ubers here, your best way to beat this stage is to go purely offensive with [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]]. Take your time at the start and use the Angel Sluggy to stack up Cyberpunk Cat. Once he's around halfway done his cooldown, you can start sending out your other units to kill the Slug.

On base hit, you are greeted with an absolute abomination of an enemy composition. Use three meatshields to stall the composite Le'Saint and Selena, and have [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] Freeze the Gorilliam. If he fails you and your units die, you still have your backup Cyberpunks to help you. Continue spamming meatshields and backliner units, while watching your money carefully and eventually each threat should die off one by one.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Awakened Ururun]]: Ururun's high range and DPS allows her to chip down the boss horde here.
*[[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]]: Extremely strong LD attacker able to create very damaging Savage Blows.
*[[Catway (Super Rare Cat)|Time Traveller Cat]]: Even at a low level, Time Traveller is a super strong unit that has pretty good DPS against three of the four threats here. He also has a combo with Cyberpunk to gain more money from defeated enemies.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*Universal Nukers: Examples include [[Shining Amaterasu (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Amaterasu]], [[Baby Gao (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Lord Gao]], [[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Sunrise Sirius]], [[Gaia the Creator (Legend Rare Cat)|Gaia the Supreme]] and [[Child of Destiny Phono (Uber Rare Cat)|King of Destiny Phono]]. Each of these units have very high range and effective damage against Traited enemies, allowing you to even play fully offensive if boosted enough and remove Cyberpunk from your lineup. If they aren't, you can combine them with Cyberpunk to result in an easy victory.
*Trait Nukers: Examples include [[Pai-Pai (Uber Rare Cat)|Pai-Pai DX]], [[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Dark Catman]], [[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bazibastra]], and [[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Jizo's Mega-Castle]]. While they aren't nearly as strong as the universal nukers, they can still remove one of the bosses fairly quickly and make your life a lot easier.
*CC Units: Examples include [[Empress Chronos (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Chronos]] and [[Miko Mitama (Uber Rare Cat)|Mitama the Oracle]]. These units have extremely strong CC that put Cyberpunk to shame here and allow your units to have an easier time chipping down the boss horde.
